   504	    log tail so skipping fsync is the right trade-off. If the sidecar
   505	    is corrupt or absent after a crash, :func:`read_prev_hmac` returns
   506	    genesis and the chain reseals on next write (operator sees a
   507	    one-line break in verify-chain, distinguishable from tamper via
   508	    monotonic ``ts``).
